      "summary": "Accepted with defects, all non-blocking. Probed with rebuilds between legs: ungating updateStationBedsideApproach fails clause (ii-c); emptying the station table fails clause (ii) with expected 'refused' to be 'admitted'; replacing the committed record's digests with f*64 and routeLengthMeters with 99.5 fails clause (o) with the committed record drifted from the files on disk. The frame-loop gate can be FALSE in a shipped run (first frame seeds no_plan_carried; stale geometry refuses evidence_changed) and a null approachFrame is handled at main.ts:3480. Ratchets unmoved, registries add-only, all 38 diff paths inside the frozen scopes or the card's allowlist.",
