          "severity": "non-blocking",
          "finding": "The BOOT-path admission result is still write-only. encounter-bundle-boot/index.ts:262 writes scenePlanAdmission and no production code reads it off the boot evidence; main.ts recomputes the admission itself at :3452. The boot refusal binds no encounter: it is evidence, not enforcement. The card's stated gate is the frame loop, which is honest."
        },
